<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on ABB AB.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on ABB AB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on ABB AB shares, lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS CONTROL ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	04.SEP.98		 PAYDATE	04.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  855 SEK</p>
<p>* * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE     STRIKE     PRICE	PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL     855 SEK    10.36 SEK  12.12 PCT   8.25 X</p>
<p> CALL     900 SEK    8.05 SEK   14.67 PCT   10.63 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
